<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 1700s BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 18th century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 1700s BCE, 60 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 10 were founded and 20 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Assyrian Empire, the Babylonian Empire and the Elamite Confederation.</p></header>
